[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0010","text":"千雪姐……？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0020","text":"工作结束后，\n能走在这么漂亮的地方，好开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0030","text":"感觉就像来到了国外一样，不是吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0040","text":"就是啊，在这么时尚的地方\n奖励散步☆　简直太棒了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0050","text":"而且……还有好香的味道……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0060","text":"真的呢……啊，那边好像有咖啡烘焙坊\n……有点小激动呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0070","text":"海浪的声音，海的味道……混在一起……\n……啊，哪里好像在演奏爵士乐……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0080","text":"甘奈酱、甜花酱\n可以慢慢走一会儿吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0090","text":"嗯……！／当然！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0100","text":"谢谢！\n感觉这会是一次，非常愉快的夜间散步……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
